# ASK-1 · A permission ask, a no, and a yes from now on (stand-in: [ask]).
start
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type mend shelf.py [ask]
key Enter
key Escape Escape
see run .imece/worktree-setup.sh
key g d
key a
see run Bash: python3 -m pip
key g d
see a  allow once   r  refuse   e  yes this turn
key r
see run .imece/check on its
key g d
key a
see python3 -m pip --version did not run: The person
# The same command again: a yes from now on for the project.
key /
type mend cli.py [ask]
key Enter
key Escape Escape
see run Bash: python3 -m pip
key g d
key A
# The journal keeps it (a flash may be gone before it is looked at).
key J
see shelf: you say yes from now on to python3 -m pip
key Escape
type :allow
key Enter
see python3 -m pip
# A third time asks nothing: its change comes with no ask before it.
key /
type mend test_shelf.py [ask]
key Enter
key Escape Escape
wait 60 #3   mend test_shelf
gone permissions
